<title>FRANCE: Carrefour August sales rise 8.7 pct.</title>
<headline>Carrefour August sales rise 8.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    August 1996 turnover			14,480    up 8.7 pct</p>
<p>     - in France				   8,524    up 7.0 pct</p>
<p>    Jan-Aug 1996 turnover		    110,729    up 6.5 pct</p>
<p>     - in France				  65,863    up 3.5 pct</p>
<p>NOTE - Carrefour said in a statement that it opened an 11th store in Mexico in August, in Cuernavaca, and an 11th store in Taiwan.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
